AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000577> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000577> "A symbol that is part of a CRID and that is sufficient to look up a record from the CRID's registry."@en)
